    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>When you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>, it is merely part of a larger attack pattern that you continue to execute.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> After you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>, you can take <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Actions\">Free Actions</a> before your turn ends.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Without this Feat, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charging\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charging\">Charging</a> ends your turn immediately after the attack is resolved.</p>",
